Grammar

    0 $accept: loop $end

    1 loop: S_1 S_2

    2 aLine: aList
    3      | `.`

    4 aList: S_3

    5 S_1: ε
    6      | NL

    7 S_2_E: S_2_E NL aLine
    8      | aLine
    9      | S_2_E NL

   10 S_2: S_2_E

   11 S_3_L: LONG
   12      | S_3_L `,` LONG

   13 S_3: S_3_L


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    `.` (258) 3
    `,` (259) 12
    LONG (260) 11 12
    NL (261) 6 7 9


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (7)
        on left: 0
    loop (8)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    aLine (9)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 7 8
    aList (10)
        on left: 4
        on right: 2
    S_1 (11)
        on left: 5 6
        on right: 1
    S_2_E (12)
        on left: 7 8 9
        on right: 7 9 10
    S_2 (13)
        on left: 10
        on right: 1
    S_3_L (14)
        on left: 11 12
        on right: 12 13
    S_3 (15)
        on left: 13
        on right: 4


State 0

    0 $accept: • loop $end

    NL  shift, and go to state 1

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (S_1)

    loop  go to state 2
    S_1  go to state 3


State 1

    6 S_1: NL •

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (S_1)


State 2

    0 $accept: loop • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 4


State 3

    1 loop: S_1 • S_2

    `.`  shift, and go to state 5
    LONG  shift, and go to state 6

    aLine  go to state 7
    aList  go to state 8
    S_2_E  go to state 9
    S_2  go to state 10
    S_3_L  go to state 11
    S_3  go to state 12


State 4

    0 $accept: loop $end •

    $default  accept


State 5

    3 aLine: `.` •

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (aLine)


State 6

   11 S_3_L: LONG •

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (S_3_L)


State 7

    8 S_2_E: aLine •

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (S_2_E)


State 8

    2 aLine: aList •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (aLine)


State 9

    7 S_2_E: S_2_E • NL aLine
    9      | S_2_E • NL
   10 S_2: S_2_E •

    NL  shift, and go to state 13

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (S_2)


State 10

    1 loop: S_1 S_2 •

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (loop)


State 11

   12 S_3_L: S_3_L • `,` LONG
   13 S_3: S_3_L •

    `,`  shift, and go to state 14

    $default  reduce using rule 13 (S_3)


State 12

    4 aList: S_3 •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (aList)


State 13

    7 S_2_E: S_2_E NL • aLine
    9      | S_2_E NL •

    `.`  shift, and go to state 5
    LONG  shift, and go to state 6

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (S_2_E)

    aLine  go to state 15
    aList  go to state 8
    S_3_L  go to state 11
    S_3  go to state 12


State 14

   12 S_3_L: S_3_L `,` • LONG

    LONG  shift, and go to state 16


State 15

    7 S_2_E: S_2_E NL aLine •

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (S_2_E)


State 16

   12 S_3_L: S_3_L `,` LONG •

    $default  reduce using rule 12 (S_3_L)
